  "description": "<h3>Description</h3>\n<p>Australians have long been innovators in the field of clothes drying. Sea to Summit is proud to continue this tradition with this no stretch, no peg, adjustable clothesline. Light and compact enough to travel with.</p>\n<div><br></div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div><br></div>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Clothesline measures 3.5 Metres</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Unique beaded cord design secures items even in the wind</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Reflective cord for visibility at night</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Stows away in the tiniest neoprene pouch</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>Weight: 25g</li>\n<li>Volume: 100ml/200ml</li>\n<li>Packed size 50 x 70 x 20mm</li>\n</ul>\n<p><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wSptAa2sst0\" width=\"1136\" height=\"640\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe></p>\n</div>",
